ory":{"id":"S11115","name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,78,70,43,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,78,70,43,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1023","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[79,78,70,43,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10001","city":"CS1026","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[79,78,70,43,59,66],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"100","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP1005702","armor":"WP1006705","helmet":"WP1023505"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"曹魏武将。少年时有雄气，好任侠。在曹操陈留起兵之初，便以门客身份投入麾下。因深得信任，被委以中军校尉。官渡之战时担任徐晃部将，并生擒了袁绍细作，探得情报，奉命前去烧毁了袁绍部将韩猛的运粮车，袁军补给崩溃，为乌巢决战铺垫。后随曹操讨伐袁绍余党时，出战迎战袁尚，被其射中左眼而亡。","tc":"曹魏武將。少年時有雄氣，好任俠。在曹操陳留起兵之初，便以門客身份投入麾下。因深得信任，被委以中軍校尉。官渡之戰時擔任徐晃部將，并生擒了袁紹細作，探得情報，奉命前去燒毀了袁紹部將韓猛的運糧車，袁軍補給崩潰，為烏巢決戰鋪墊。后隨曹操討伐袁紹余黨時，出戰迎戰袁尚，被其射中左眼而亡。","en":"An officer of Cao Wei. In his youth, he possessed great spirit and was fond of chivalric deeds. When Cao Cao first raised an army in Chenliu, he joined him as a retainer. Deeply trusted, he was appointed Colonel of the Central Army. During the Battle of Guandu, he served as Xu Huang's subordinate officer and captured a spy of Yuan Shao's to gather intelligence, then was ordered to burn the supply wagons of Yuan Shao's general Han Meng, collapsing the Yuan army's supply lines and setting the stage for the decisive battle at Wuchao. Later, while accompanying Cao Cao to subjugate the remnants of Yuan Shao's forces, he rode out to face Yuan Shang, but was shot in the left eye and killed.","jp":"曹魏の武将。少年の頃より気骨があり、任侠を好んだ。曹操が陳留で挙兵した当初、食客としてその配下に加わった。深い信任を得て中軍校尉に任じられる。官渡の戦いでは徐晃の部将を務め、袁紹の間者を生け捕りにして情報を探り出し、命を受けて袁紹の部将・韓猛の兵糧車を焼き払った。これにより袁紹軍の補給は破綻し、烏巣の決戦への布石となった。のちに曹操に従い袁紹の残党を討伐した際、袁尚を迎撃すべく出陣したが、左目を射抜かれて戦死した。","kr":"조위의 무장. 젊은 시절 웅대한 기개가 있었고 협기를 좋아했다. 조조가 진류에서 거병했을 때 문객의 신분으로 휘하에 들어갔으며, 두터운 신임을 얻어 중군교위에 임명되었다. 관도대전 당시 서황의 부장으로 참전하여 원소의 세작을 사로잡아 정보를 입수했고, 명을 받아 원소의 부장 한맹의 군량 수송 수레를 불태웠다. 이로써 원소군의 보급을 무너뜨려 오소 결전의 발판을 마련했다. 이후 조조를 따라 원소의 잔당을 토벌할 때 출전하여 원상과 맞서 싸우다, 원상이 쏜 화살에 왼쪽 눈을 맞고 전사했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10502","remark":"","surname":"史","surnameTc":"史","surnameEn":"Shi","surnameJp":"史","surnameKr":"사","surnameOther":"","name":"涣","nameTc":"渙","nameEn":"Huan","nameJp":"渙","nameKr":"환","nameOther":"","word":"公刘","wordTc":"公劉","wordEn":"Gongliu","wordJp":"公劉","wordKr":"공유","wordOther":"","icon":"史涣","power":"WJ10001","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"190","city":"CS1023","gender":"0","rule":"79","force":"78","wise":"70","politics":"43","charm":"59","will":"66","ruleTalent":"10","forceTalent":"9","wiseTalent":"8","politicsTalent":"3","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"7","weaponMaster":"67/24/24/24/24/54/50/24","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"1009202;1000205","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"6200","battleSoulPoi